WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:03.970
You dummy!

00:06.740 --> 00:07.810
It's Natsuko!

00:07.810 --> 00:08.980
Kill Natsuko!

00:09.970 --> 00:11.110
Natsuko!

00:13.860 --> 00:15.910
Kill her!

00:16.860 --> 00:18.640
Stop!

00:30.510 --> 00:31.800
It disappeared?

00:31.800 --> 00:33.900
Did we do it?

00:33.900 --> 00:35.760
I think we did.

00:35.760 --> 00:38.780
Yeah! We did it!

00:38.780 --> 00:40.350
We did it!

00:40.350 --> 00:42.280
We defeated Natsuko!

02:15.030 --> 02:19.740
Episode 11: DESPAIR

02:15.410 --> 02:19.330
H-Hey, did you guys see 
Master Unio there, too?

02:19.740 --> 02:22.450
I-It's all Natsuko's fault!

02:22.450 --> 02:25.060
Natsuko led Master Unio to his death!

02:25.060 --> 02:28.550
And <i>we</i> defeated Natsuko!

02:30.320 --> 02:33.370
Unthinkable. Lady Natsuko has been...

02:33.370 --> 02:34.870
Lady Natsuko...

02:49.390 --> 02:50.780
Voids!

02:55.310 --> 02:59.110
Have no fear! We defeated Natsuko!

03:03.500 --> 03:04.620
We did it.

03:08.000 --> 03:09.340
This is...

03:09.340 --> 03:13.780
Lady Natsuko must have summoned 
these Voids to end the world!

03:13.780 --> 03:15.580
Ultimate Void!

03:16.510 --> 03:17.990
Ultimate Void!

03:19.000 --> 03:20.120
Ultimate—

03:45.880 --> 03:46.810
Luke!

03:47.780 --> 03:49.430
Where are Natsuko and Unio?

03:49.940 --> 03:51.250
Eaten...

03:51.250 --> 03:52.120
What?

03:52.550 --> 03:55.230
The Void ate them...

03:55.940 --> 03:56.970
And everyone...

03:57.970 --> 03:58.970
Everyone...

04:08.210 --> 04:09.650
Get a hold of yourself!

04:13.060 --> 04:16.880
Mommy! Mommy!

04:15.600 --> 04:17.900
Someone! Someone, please save us!

04:18.950 --> 04:22.780
I'll get everyone to shelter! 
Luke, take care of the Soul Future!

04:28.320 --> 04:29.310
Run!

04:50.030 --> 04:51.270
Can it be...

04:55.500 --> 04:58.760
Can we pull off this 
forbidden spell on our own?

04:58.760 --> 05:02.350
Memmeln believed in us 
and entrusted us with this task.

05:02.660 --> 05:07.100
She said if this succeeds, 
it should cheer Natsuko up.

05:07.100 --> 05:08.020
Right.

05:10.900 --> 05:12.870
Let us hurry, Meg.

05:12.870 --> 05:14.620
Indeed, Sally.

05:19.630 --> 05:21.510
This way! Hurry!

05:28.060 --> 05:31.130
I see the time has finally arrived.

05:32.260 --> 05:34.270
Elder Baobab! Come with us to the shelter!

05:34.270 --> 05:36.280
Soon, this town will be destroyed.

05:36.280 --> 05:37.220
What?

05:37.460 --> 05:40.080
I will be fine on my own.

05:40.620 --> 05:45.170
You two go spend your final moments
 with your loved ones.

05:49.540 --> 05:52.450
Hurry. There's no more time.

05:52.450 --> 05:53.860
Y-Yes, ma'am!

05:55.790 --> 05:57.870
The Nine Soldiers...

05:58.320 --> 06:04.680
You were our true light that shone down 
on us and gave us hope until the very end.

06:05.140 --> 06:06.510
Thank you.

06:07.280 --> 06:12.050
I will watch as this perishing world
 lives out its destiny.

06:23.130 --> 06:24.280
Now! Go!

06:24.280 --> 06:26.470
Hurry! Run!

06:35.780 --> 06:37.590
What the hell is going on?

06:37.590 --> 06:40.150
These aren't the usual Voids.

06:40.660 --> 06:42.400
Something's off.

06:44.980 --> 06:48.540
It's no use trying to 
revise the movie anymore.

06:48.540 --> 06:53.930
The climax to <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>
 has already begun.

06:55.550 --> 06:56.900
Now, come with us!

06:56.000 --> 06:56.960
Stop.

06:56.900 --> 06:59.040
Surrender! Stop struggling!

06:57.690 --> 07:00.570
Lady Natsuko summoned them
 to put an end to this world.

06:59.040 --> 07:00.560
What are you doing?

07:00.570 --> 07:07.560
<i>After this battle, I wonder how much time
 we'll have until the next one...</i>

07:09.810 --> 07:13.300
<i>I'll go up into the sky on Unio,
see how this town is doing,</i>

07:13.930 --> 07:16.570
<i>and how the other kingdoms are doing, too.</i>

07:18.580 --> 07:20.570
<i>Since we'll be heading that way,</i>

07:20.570 --> 07:23.860
<i>I should go pick some mushrooms 
in the western mountains.</i>

07:23.860 --> 07:29.590
<i>The last time I made a pie with those 
mushrooms, everyone really enjoyed it.</i>

07:31.460 --> 07:34.960
<i>I'd love for Natsuko to try it.</i>

07:37.140 --> 07:41.230
<i>Natsuko... I wonder how 
many days she'll sleep this time.</i>

07:41.680 --> 07:44.600
<i>She's probably going to sleep 
for a while after this one.</i>

07:45.030 --> 07:47.280
<i>That means she'll eat a lot
 when she wakes up.</i>

07:47.770 --> 07:50.240
<i>I don't think the pie will be enough.</i>

07:50.640 --> 07:55.330
<i>I'm going to make a bunch 
of things that Natsuko loves.</i>

07:57.070 --> 07:58.240
<i>Natsuko...</i>

09:39.680 --> 09:43.010
<i>Huh? Th-The studio?</i>

09:43.010 --> 09:47.070
<i>Wasn't I reborn into 
the world of </i>A Tale of Perishing<i>?</i>

