You had all that time, 
and this is all you could do?

10:02.540 --> 10:03.710
This is shit.

10:04.790 --> 10:05.580
Huh?

10:10.220 --> 10:11.840
She's supposedly a genius.

10:11.840 --> 10:13.090
Like, how?

10:13.090 --> 10:14.760
This isn't interesting at all.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.630
It's just normal. Actually, it's dated.

10:16.630 --> 10:18.080
She has no talent.

10:18.080 --> 10:20.340
Huh? Wh-What is this?

10:18.080 --> 10:20.350
Get off your high horse.

10:19.070 --> 10:20.340
Just quit already.

10:20.340 --> 10:21.440
Seriously.

10:21.440 --> 10:22.550
Who do you think you are?

10:23.140 --> 10:24.390
You suck.

10:31.110 --> 10:34.410
How do you feel after making that epic flop?

10:34.410 --> 10:35.820
I want my time back.

10:35.820 --> 10:36.940
That sucked.

10:36.940 --> 10:39.230
Quit making stuff that sucks.

10:39.230 --> 10:40.950
Totally worthless.

10:40.950 --> 10:43.200
Genius director, my ass.

10:43.200 --> 10:44.950
What a disappointment.

10:45.490 --> 10:46.830
I want a refund.

10:46.830 --> 10:47.900
Totally lame.

10:49.340 --> 10:51.710
Talk about a failure.

10:51.710 --> 10:53.000
Dumbass.

10:53.700 --> 10:54.740
What a shitty movie.

