Don't push yourself too hard.

13:03.490 --> 13:07.460
Sorry. But I have to get stronger.

13:08.740 --> 13:11.090
The war's gonna start again.

13:11.090 --> 13:14.790
I have to protect the Soul Futures,
 no matter what.

13:17.110 --> 13:18.570
Don't worry.

13:18.820 --> 13:22.370
I'm gonna protect you, no matter what, Luke.

13:25.120 --> 13:32.800
Unio, if the world is ever at peace 
and we don't have to fight anyone anymore,

13:32.800 --> 13:34.920
why don't we go off somewhere?

13:35.330 --> 13:38.460
When I don't have to be 
the legendary hero anymore, I mean.

13:38.460 --> 13:40.210
Just plain ol' you and me.

13:41.570 --> 13:44.200
Yeah, that's a great idea!

13:44.200 --> 13:47.250
Let's go see a ton of things 
we've never seen before!

13:47.250 --> 13:51.020
Wow, I'm so excited.

13:52.350 --> 13:55.090
But I wonder if a day 
like that will ever come.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.800
It will, for sure.

14:00.330 --> 14:02.740
I can't wait, Unio.

14:05.760 --> 14:07.290
Wh-What is this place?

14:07.290 --> 14:10.110
Where are you, Natsuko?

14:10.110 --> 14:14.110
Hey! Where are you? Answer me!

14:14.110 --> 14:17.620
Natsuko!

14:24.120 --> 14:27.940
Ah, over there! Natsuko!

14:30.940 --> 14:32.390
Damn it.

14:35.400 --> 14:37.440
I can't move.

14:37.440 --> 14:39.140
I-I can't breathe.

14:43.110 --> 14:46.780
We're not the ones 
who can help Luke out this time.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.160
It's Natsuko.

14:48.840 --> 14:51.240
You know that, don't you?

14:55.420 --> 14:56.740
Damn it!

14:56.740 --> 14:58.120
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

14:58.120 --> 15:00.340
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it! 
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

15:00.340 --> 15:03.000
