15:23.010 --> 15:24.270
I don't wanna go.

15:24.270 --> 15:25.660
Huh?

15:25.960 --> 15:29.700
When I died, I was honestly relieved.

15:31.390 --> 15:33.920
I didn't have to think 
about anything anymore.

15:34.920 --> 15:37.300
I didn't have to do anything anymore.

15:38.810 --> 15:40.980
I could finally run away.

15:46.370 --> 15:49.920
I was so, <i>so</i> relieved.

15:54.710 --> 15:57.310
Would you knock it off 
with the pity party already?!

16:00.310 --> 16:02.570
I <i>hate</i> you.

16:05.550 --> 16:06.620
But...

16:07.110 --> 16:09.530
I hate to admit it, but it can't be me.

16:09.980 --> 16:13.310
<i>You're</i> the one who has to save Luke!

16:13.940 --> 16:17.580
Me? Save Luke?

16:17.580 --> 16:21.080
I've been with Luke forever.
Way longer than you.

16:21.520 --> 16:26.960
So I know way, <i>way</i> more about Luke than you!

16:27.260 --> 16:31.210
Ever since you showed up, 
Luke has changed so much.

16:31.580 --> 16:33.210
He's having fun.

16:33.210 --> 16:35.490
And he just seems so happy.

16:35.970 --> 16:39.010
I've never seen Luke like that.

16:40.390 --> 16:44.280
Your drawings are what's saving Luke.

16:44.900 --> 16:46.760
So I...

16:47.560 --> 16:49.880
I love your drawings.

16:52.440 --> 16:59.120
I absolutely <i>love</i> your drawings!

17:11.270 --> 17:15.210
Do you remember when 
we saw <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>?

17:15.580 --> 17:16.830
You're...

17:16.830 --> 17:21.940
You were so amazed and excited,
your heart just wouldn't stop pounding.

17:23.970 --> 17:27.290
A <i>Tale of Perishing</i> is where I got my start.

17:27.290 --> 17:31.700
And ever since, we've been obsessed with 
the world of <i>A Tale of Perishing</i>, haven't we?

