Wait, you really <i>were</i> crying?

20:34.510 --> 20:37.290
Wow. So you actually do know how to cry?

20:37.290 --> 20:40.890
Aha, I see. Heh. So you do cry.

20:40.890 --> 20:44.680
Shut up, you dumb pack mule! 
Haven't you ever heard of tact?

20:44.680 --> 20:48.920
Shut up, black-haired gremlin! You're the <i>last</i>
 person who can lecture me on a lack of tact!

20:56.630 --> 20:58.940
Okay. Let's go.

21:18.710 --> 21:22.160
I knew it. These Voids... They're connected.

21:36.450 --> 21:41.720
All to protect this stupid thing? 
Why did everyone have to die for that?

22:15.770 --> 22:18.580
It's all your fault.

23:50.030 --> 23:54.940
<b>Episode 12: ZENSHU</b>

